  "abstract": "Open-source identity and access management platform for SaaS and AI apps, built on OpenID Connect and OAuth 2.1. Offers a hosted sign-in experience with passwordless, social, passkey and enterprise SSO (SAML and OIDC) options, multi-factor authentication, organizations for multi-tenant B2B apps, RBAC and API protection, and can act as a SAML identity provider. Webhooks, custom token claims and Actions cover extensibility, and SDKs and quick starts span 30+ frameworks. Available as Logto Cloud (Free, Pro and Enterprise plans) or self-hosted under the MPL-2.0 license.",
